<title>ITALY: Italy bourse trade blocked due to technical hitch.</title>
<headline>Italy bourse trade blocked due to technical hitch.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the Italian stock market was blocked early on Friday due to technical problems, the stock market council said.</p>
<p>Trading on the cash market was affected but derivatives were not and the council would announce later when trading would resume, it said.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
